jñāna-nirdhūta-kalmaṣāḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1663,\"bb\":1471,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/17/b1471/\",\"shadow_value\":\"tat-buddhayaḥ – those whose intelligence is always in the Supreme; tat-ātmānaḥ – those whose minds are always in the Supreme; tat-niṣṭhāḥ – those whose faith is only meant for the Supreme; tat-parāyaṇāḥ – who have completely taken shelter of Him; gacchanti – go; apunaḥ-āvṛttim – to liberation; jñāna – by knowledge; nirdhūta – cleansed; kalmaṣāḥ – misgivings.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"tat-buddhayaḥ\",\"translation\":\"those whose intelligence is always in the Supreme\"},{\"word\":\"tat-ātmānaḥ\",\"translation\":\"those whose minds are always in the Supreme\"},{\"word\":\"tat-niṣṭhāḥ\",\"translation\":\"those whose faith is only meant for the Supreme\"},{\"word\":\"tat-parāyaṇāḥ\",\"translation\":\"who have completely taken shelter of Him\"},{\"word\":\"gacchanti\",\"translation\":\"go\"},{\"word\":\"apunaḥ-āvṛttim\",\"translation\":\"to liberation\"},{\"word\":\"jñāna\",\"translation\":\"by knowledge\"},{\"word\":\"nirdhūta\",\"translation\":\"cleansed\"},{\"word\":\"kalmaṣāḥ\",\"translation\":\"misgivings\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1664,\"bb\":1472,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/17/b1472/\",\"body_value\":\"When one’s intelligence, mind, faith and refuge are all fixed in the Supreme, then one becomes fully cleansed of misgivings through complete knowledge and thus proceeds straight on the path of liberation.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1665,\"bb\":1473,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/17/b1473/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 5.17\",\"medium_ti